 "remarks": "Location, Location, Location...in the heart of Downtown Darien, this Exceptional End-unit Townhouse offers unparalleled convenience & providing walkable access to premier dining, shopping, and the Darien Metro-North station. Recently and gorgeously remodeled to the Highest Standards, this residence encompasses over 2,000 square feet of sophisticated living space, featuring an expansive third-floor Den/Office, which can serve as a versatile 3rd-bedroom, with multiple walk-in closets and a \"secret\" feature. The Gourmet Kitchen is outfitted with top-tier Sub-Zero & Wolf appliances, including Induction Cooktop, while the Primary Suite boasts vaulted ceilings exceeding 14 feet and a spa-inspired bathroom complete with a soaking tub, large walk-in shower and linen closet. The home is enhanced by WAC recessed lighting throughout, central vacuum and ample custom storage solutions. Notably, this is the only unit within Middlesex Commons that features direct interior access to a private, 800+ square-foot basement with approx. 8-foot ceilings, further distinguishing this property as a rare find in the current market. Tucked away on a quiet private road, Middlesex Commons unfolds across 11 acres of meticulously manicured, park-like grounds. This premier community offers a true resort-style sanctuary, featuring a sparkling, heated saltwater pool and a fully equipped pool house. Elevating the residential experience, the charming HOA guest cottage serves as an exclusive, welcoming haven",
